[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551793512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100567#issuecomment-2551793512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100567","id":2551793512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YGUdo","user":{"login":"ThePhantomLemon","id":6132794,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzI3OTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6132794?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePhantomLemon","html_url":"https://github.com/ThePhantomLemon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePhantomLemon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePhantomLemon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePhantomLemon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePhantomLemon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePhantomLemon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePhantomLemon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePhantomLemon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePhantomLemon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePhantomLemon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-18T16:39:00Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T16:39:00Z","body":"Just noticed that this is also the case with expanded margins in general, not just skewed boxes. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551793512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368151185","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100567#issuecomment-3368151185","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100567","id":3368151185,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IweiR","user":{"login":"LunaCapra","id":50772474,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzcyNDc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50772474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra","html_url":"https://github.com/LunaCapra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-04T11:39:02Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T11:47:03Z","body":"Seems I failed to put in the correct keywords to find this issue\nHowever from my testing:\n\nThis is reproducible in:\n- v4.0.stable.official [92bee43ad]\n\nand still reproducible in:\n- v4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n- v4.6.dev.custom_build [6d33ad291]\n\nand is affected by anything that makes the stylebox exceed its bounds, be it skew, expand margins, shadow or otherwise.\n\nA workaround that seems to work is using \"Clip + Draw\" with a shader such as\n```\nshader_type canvas_item;\nrender_mode unshaded;\n\nuniform sampler2D screen_texture : hint_screen_texture, repeat_disable, filter_nearest;\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tCOLOR = textureLod(screen_texture, SCREEN_UV, 0.0);\n}\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368151185/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381461325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100567#issuecomment-3381461325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100567","id":3381461325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JjQFN","user":{"login":"LunaCapra","id":50772474,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzcyNDc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50772474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra","html_url":"https://github.com/LunaCapra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T13:08:35Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T12:38:20Z","body":"Some more info I could gather after digging around in the canvas item renderer:\n\n1. This also happens for `StyleBoxTexture`\n2. Another possible workaround is using `RendererCanvasCull::canvas_item_set_custom_rect` (or `RenderingServer.canvas_item_set_custom_rect` in GDScript) to set a custom rect that encompasses the entire stylebox like this:\n```gdscript\nvar stylebox: StyleBoxTexture = get_theme_stylebox(&\"panel\")\nvar rect := Rect2()\nrect.size = size\nrect.position.x -= stylebox.expand_margin_left\nrect.position.y -= stylebox.expand_margin_top\nrect.size.x += stylebox.expand_margin_left + stylebox.expand_margin_right\nrect.size.y += stylebox.expand_margin_top + stylebox.expand_margin_bottom\nRenderingServer.canvas_item_set_custom_rect(get_canvas_item(), true, rect)\n```\nseemingly this should be done here already\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/cb7cd815eeeb11aaa1f68453a515c76bec5ba73d/scene/resources/style_box_texture.cpp#L173-L176\n\nBut this seems to be lost somewhere in `renderer_canvas_render.cpp`'s `get_rect()` method when reconstructing it as when called here\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/cb7cd815eeeb11aaa1f68453a515c76bec5ba73d/servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_cull.cpp#L332\nit's already no longer taking into account the expand margins.\nIn fact the block recreating the rect from the commands seems to never be reached as the early return with `commands == nullptr` always fires from my testing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381461325/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3393322009","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100567#issuecomment-3393322009","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100567","id":3393322009,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KQfwZ","user":{"login":"LunaCapra","id":50772474,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzcyNDc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50772474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra","html_url":"https://github.com/LunaCapra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-11T13:16:35Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T09:43:51Z","body":"I've updated my previous comment with some more details but it seems that the main issue is that when\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/cb7cd815eeeb11aaa1f68453a515c76bec5ba73d/servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_cull.cpp#L332\nhappens, the `commands` pointer of `ci` is always `nullptr` resulting in the return of an empty `Rect2`.\nThis means that the logic for recreating the rect from the draw commands never runs and as such only gets corrected to the clip rect; that being the regular control bounds.\n\n***Edit: This only happens with control nodes, not regular 2D canvas items.***","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3393322009/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]